### ⚠️ Salary data ke liye

Yahan ek important distinction rakhenge. **Average package ko fixed universal truth ki tarah nahi dikhana chahiye**, kyunki salary company, location, experience, skills aur market ke according change hoti hai.

Better UI:

```text
Entry Level
₹3–6 LPA

Typical Range
₹4–8 LPA

Experienced
₹8–20+ LPA
```

Aur clearly:

> *Salary figures are indicative estimates and may vary by company, location, experience and skills.*

Isse project zyada **professional aur honest** lagega.

