## 🏗️ 4 files ka final responsibility

| File         | Responsibility                                 |
| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `index.html` | UI + wizard + dashboard containers             |
| `style.css`  | Custom styling / animations / overrides        |
| `data.js`    | Complete career database                       |
| `script.js`  | Filtering + recommendation + dynamic rendering |

Aur **backend ki zarurat nahi** hogi. GitHub Pages par static deployment ke liye ye architecture suitable hai.

### Sabse important principle

Hum PathFinder ko sirf:

> **“Course search website”**

nahi banayenge.

Uska actual USP hoga:

> **“If I choose X, where can I go next?”**

For example:

```text
Science
   ↓
B.Tech CSE
   ↓
Computer Science
   ↓
Software Engineering
   ↓
Required Skills
   ↓
Projects
   ↓
Internship
   ↓
Placement
```

Isi tarah:

```text
Commerce
   ↓
B.Com
   ↓
Accounting / Finance
   ↓
CA / Financial Analyst / Accountant / Banking
   ↓
Required Skills
   ↓
Certifications / Projects
   ↓
Internship
   ↓
Job
